            <note corresp="#d198-f2" n="3" xml:id="d198-f2-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d198-f3" n="4" xml:id="d198-f3-content">
                <p>A committee concerned with food control, upon which served representatives of
                    Great Britain, France, Italy, and the United States.</p>
            </note>
